  "assembly_notes": [
    "cloud-helpers.mjs assembles exact code excerpts, adds provenance comments and a harness export list. The entryTeams export present in the original is preserved. All helper dependencies used by tested paths are included as exact excerpts; no provider/team logic is stubbed.",
    "sql-evidence.json contains two exact table definitions and exact SQL expressions plus small code-context excerpts. Parsing removes Go literal delimiters/SQL list punctuation only.",
    "Fixtures and test assertions are newly authored synthetic inputs. The Node harness freezes only the clock; SQLite runs in memory. Neither harness executes an API route or production service.",
    "The comparator COALESCE(fa.cost,usage_event.cost) is an authored equivalent of the included Go event cost precedence branch, not a claimed verbatim repository SQL expression."
